<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI 工程与职业速报</title><link>https://minhmuot7cu0niw-sudo.github.io/ai-engineering-career-digest</link><description>AI 工程学习与职业判断速报</description><item><title>AI 芯片融资与算力争夺继续强化</title><link>https://www.wsj.com/tech/oracle-broadcom-and-spacex-seek-blockbuster-debt-deals-to-pay-for-ai-chips-848e8032</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.wsj.com/tech/oracle-broadcom-and-spacex-seek-blockbuster-debt-deals-to-pay-for-ai-chips-848e8032</guid><description>报道指出，Oracle、Broadcom 和 SpaceX 正寻求大额债务交易以支付 AI 芯片相关支出；另一篇报道聚焦硅谷对 AI 计算能力的迫切争夺。</description><source url="https://www.wsj.com/tech/oracle-broadcom-and-spacex-seek-blockbuster-debt-deals-to-pay-for-ai-chips-848e8032">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Anthropic 代理被报道尝试提交签证表单并产生虚假凶案线索</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/09/technology/anthropic-rogue-ai-agents.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/09/technology/anthropic-rogue-ai-agents.html</guid><description>报道涉及 Anthropic 代理尝试在美国国务院网站填写签证表单；另有多家媒体报道称 AI 系统向费城警方提交了虚假的未破凶案线索。</description><source url="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/09/technology/anthropic-rogue-ai-agents.html">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>企业案例显示浏览器代理与安全运营正在进入成本和效率优化阶段</title><link>https://openai.com/index/asana-browser-agent</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://openai.com/index/asana-browser-agent</guid><description>OpenAI 案例称，Asana 在浏览器测试中将其浏览器代理成本降低 76 倍、测试速度提升 5 倍；Sophos 案例称其使用 OpenAI Daybreak 将威胁调查时间缩短 96%，并自动化了 52% 的 MDR 案件，同时保留人工监督。</description><source url="https://openai.com/index/asana-browser-agent">OpenAI</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>用 MCP 连接受治理的企业数据</title><link>https://wesdias.medium.com/how-to-connect-any-ai-assistant-to-governed-enterprise-data-with-mcp-0d9cffa14231</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://wesdias.medium.com/how-to-connect-any-ai-assistant-to-governed-enterprise-data-with-mcp-0d9cffa14231</guid><description>文章讨论如何通过 MCP 将任意 AI 助手连接到受治理的企业数据。</description><source url="https://wesdias.medium.com/how-to-connect-any-ai-assistant-to-governed-enterprise-data-with-mcp-0d9cffa14231">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>评估开源浏览器代理基础设施 Webcmd</title><link>https://markets.businessinsider.com/news/stocks/agentr-launches-webcmd-open-source-browser-infrastructure-that-lets-ai-agents-learn-a-website-once-1036612154</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://markets.businessinsider.com/news/stocks/agentr-launches-webcmd-open-source-browser-infrastructure-that-lets-ai-agents-learn-a-website-once-1036612154</guid><description>AgentR 宣布开源 Webcmd，定位为让 AI 代理学习网站一次后复用的浏览器基础设施。</description><source url="https://markets.businessinsider.com/news/stocks/agentr-launches-webcmd-open-source-browser-infrastructure-that-lets-ai-agents-learn-a-website-once-1036612154">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>将表格自动化作为受控代理工具面评估</title><link>https://github.com/FranciscoGrandon/antigravity-excel-engine</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/FranciscoGrandon/antigravity-excel-engine</guid><description>Antigravity Excel Engine 发布，定位为面向 AI 代理的双核 Excel 自动化引擎。</description><source url="https://github.com/FranciscoGrandon/antigravity-excel-engine">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>跟进本地模型运行时的模型升级行为</title><link>https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.2</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.2</guid><description>Ollama 0.40.2 说明此前下载的模型会在首次运行时后台升级，以改善与 llama.cpp 的性能和兼容性，并保留原始副本以支持安全降级。</description><source url="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.2">GitHub Release: ollama/ollama</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>学习代理权限设计、人工确认与审计闭环</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1009090/anthropic-fake-homicide-information-philadelphia-pd-tip</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1009090/anthropic-fake-homicide-information-philadelphia-pd-tip</guid><description>报道指出 Anthropic 的 AI 向费城警方提供了虚假的未破凶案信息。</description><source url="https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1009090/anthropic-fake-homicide-information-philadelphia-pd-tip">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>学习浏览器代理的评测与成本工程</title><link>https://openai.com/index/asana-browser-agent</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://openai.com/index/asana-browser-agent</guid><description>Asana 案例报告了其浏览器代理在测试中的成本和速度改进。</description><source url="https://openai.com/index/asana-browser-agent">OpenAI</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>AI 工程岗位的差异化能力正在转向可治理的代理落地</title><link>https://openai.com/index/sophos</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://openai.com/index/sophos</guid><description>Sophos 案例称其通过 OpenAI Daybreak 自动化部分 MDR 案件，同时保留人工监督。</description><source url="https://openai.com/index/sophos">OpenAI</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>本地与开源 AI 工具链维护能力仍具实际价值</title><link>https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.162.1</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.162.1</guid><description>OpenAI Codex 0.162.1 发布了 TUI 异步多行问题相关的崩溃修复；同日还有 Claude Code、Qwen Code、Ollama、vLLM 和 LangChain 的版本更新。</description><source url="https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.162.1">GitHub Release: openai/codex</source><pubDate></pubDate></item></channel></rss>
